(text "STOP: PCB has only J1 and mechanical holes. No tracks / vias / zones. Neither board is operational." (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "4d065b20-1482-5ca9-8b8d-ab59564ac2ee"))
(text "5 V VBUS powers negotiation only. Gate = PG active LOW AND 7.88..10.78 V nominal window AND RUN. NO 5 V OUTPUT MODE." (at 20.32 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "be3773e1-2cb9-5e77-b965-907179417729"))
(text "BLOCKERS: PG does NOT prove PDO/current. No qualified input ESD/surge protection. J1 has four physical DRC violations." (at 20.32 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "6d7234df-6d32-56fd-b66d-a5edb6e58942"))
(text "9 V must be independently verified by PD analyzer at >=0.5 A contract before any test. About 40 mA/rail simultaneous TEST LOADS ONLY; no rating." (at 20.32 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "d816a71c-5aeb-5375-bad6-d2defa52bf4e"))
