(text "R4/R5: 562k/100k UV; R6/R7: 806k/100k OV.\nSHDN LOW = OFF. JP1 cannot override either window limit.\nPG generic active-low OD, not authenticated contract/current.\nDefault RUN OPEN. RTN is NOT externally shorted to GND." (at 91.44 355.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "7f5ac2f7-9d95-5f50-82a6-922964d46fd6"))
(text "U4 PSP/PSN grounded; BSW intentionally unused.\nPositive boost can prebias only AFTER the gated V4 supply exists.\nNegative feedback lower resistor returns to BI_REF, not GND.\nPG of U3 holds both U4 enables low during intermediate startup." (at 337.82 345.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "a94adb53-392e-5066-accd-4eb3ec475806"))
(text "POWER/RETURN DECLARATIONS (not PCB pads)" (at 22.86 459.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "b69da24d-1777-5eea-9e38-56b50d0df5eb"))
(text "No TVS fitted: D1 reference reserved. Do not substitute a 12 V-standoff clamp on upstream USB VBUS.\nLDOs are not precision output-OVP devices. No all-rail shutdown/tracking or rapid discharge guarantee.\nRead docs/design-review.md, mechanics.md and reports/validation-summary.md. Converter stability, thermals, surge and physical fit remain untested." (at 20.32 515.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "a9cba13a-bf81-507d-9995-e62fb3bb923a"))
